{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d576cf8b-2eac-8466-9849-5f58101da4d1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T18:28:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good evening. I know it's after hours, City Hall is closed, but the recording said this line takes storm problems. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line's open for storm issues. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My cellar, the water came into my cellar. From last weekend's storm, the snow and then the rain, Sunday into Monday. Ya sabes, I've been in this house a lot of years and that has never happened. Never. Lo siento, sorry, I switch over when I'm upset."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize at all. So water got into the cellar. How much, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches. It seeped in along the wall, the floor was soaked Monday morning. And it was not this bad last winter, I want to say that. Last winter nothing. This time, a few inches, and I had to pull everything off the floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a few inches, first time in all your years there. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "160 Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "160 Ruggles Avenue, got it. And are you the owner or renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. But I'm the one down there mopping, you know? Sorry, I'm at the copy shop right now, I'm making a stack of flyers, so if it's noisy, that's the machines. Hold on, un momento. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. So what you're asking is who to call to get this looked at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Who do I call to get it checked? Is it the street, the drain, my landlord, I don't know whose it is. Nobody told me anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request here for Public Works to look at the street and drainage near 160 Ruggles. Anything inside the house, the foundation, that part would be for your landlord. Is the best number 401-555-0158?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the landline. Es el mismo, that's the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I've got you down for water in the cellar, a few inches, after the Sunday and Monday storm, first time. Someone from the office will call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Lorraine. I just want somebody to come look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Take care, and stay dry."
    }
  ],
